s-outline"></i> Add Personnel</button></div></section><div class="row mt-n3 px-2 position-relative" style="z-index:2"><?php foreach(array(array('total','Total Personnel'),array('licensed','Licensed Teachers'),array('non_licensed','Non-Licensed Teachers'),array('full_time','Full-time Teachers'),array('part_time','Part-time Teachers')) as $metric): ?><div class="col-lg col-md-4 col-sm-6 mt-2 px-1"><div class="metric"><strong><?= number_format((int)($totals[$metric[0]] ?? 0)); ?></strong><span><?= $metric[1]; ?></span></div></div><?php endforeach; ?></div><section class="card personnel-card"><div class="card-body"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3"><h4 class="mb-0">Personnel Records</h4><button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#personnelModal">Add Personnel</button></div><?php if($this->session->flashdata('success')): ?><div class="alert alert-success"><?= $esc($this->session->flashdata('success')); ?></div><?php endif; ?><?php if($this->session->flashdata('danger')): ?><div class="alert alert-danger"><?= $esc($this->session->flashdata('danger')); ?></div><?php endif; ?><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-hover mb-0"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Employee No.</th><th>Position</th><th>Type</th><th>License</th><th>Employment</th><th>Contact</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><?php if(empty($personnel)): ?><tr><td colspan="8" class="text-center text-muted py-4">No personnel records yet.</td></tr><?php else: foreach($personnel as $person): ?><tr><td><strong><?= $esc($person->full_name); ?></strong><br><small><?= $esc($person->sex); ?></small></td><td><?= $esc($person->employee_no); ?></td><td><?= $esc($person->position_title); ?></td><td><?= $esc($person->personnel_type); ?></td><td><?= !empty($person->licensed) ? 'Licensed' : 'Non-Licensed'; ?></td><td><?= $esc($person->employment_status); ?></td><td><?= $esc($person->email); ?><br><small><?= $esc($person->mobile_no); ?></small></td><td><a class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm" href="<?= base_url(); ?>Page/school_personnel_delete/<?= (int)$person->id; ?>" onclick="return confirm('Remove this personnel record?');"><i class="mdi mdi-delete-outline"></i></a></td></tr><?php endforeach; endif; ?></tbody></table></div></div></section></main></div><?php include(__DIR__ . '/includes/footer.php'); ?></div></div><div class="modal fade" id="personnelModal" tabindex="-1"><div class="modal-dialog modal-lg"><form class="modal-content" method="post" action="<?= base_url(); ?>Page/school_personnel_save"><div class="modal-header"><h5 class="modal-title">Add Personnel</h5><button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button></div><div class="modal-body"><div class="form-row"><div class="form-group col-md-8"><label>Full Name</label><input class="form-control" name="full_name" required></div><div class="form-group col-md-4"><label>Employee No.</label><input class="form-control" name="employee_no"></div></div><div class="form-row"><div class="form-group col-md-4"><label>Sex</label><select class="form-control" name="sex"><option value="">Select</option><option>Female</option><option>Male</option></select></div><div class="form-group col-md-4"><label>Personnel Type</label><select class="form-control" name="personnel_type"><option>Teaching</option><option>Non-Teaching</option></select></div><div class="form-group col-md-4"><label>Employment Status</label><select class="form-control" name="employment_status"><option>Full-time</option><option>Part-time</option></select></div></div><div class="form-row"><div class="form-group col-md-6"><label>Position / Designation</label><input class="form-control" name="position_title"></div><div class="form-group col-md-6 pt-4"><div class="custom-control custom-checkbox mt-2"><input class="custom-control-input" type="checkbox" id="licensed" name="licensed" value="1"><label class="custom-control-label" for="licensed">Licensed Teacher</label></div></div></div><div class="form-row"><div class="form-group col-md-6"><label>Email</label><input class="form-control" type="email" name="email"></div><div class="form-group col-md-6"><label>Mobile Number</label><input class="form-control" name="mobile_no"></div></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button type="button" class="btn btn-light" data-dismiss="modal">Cancel</button><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Save Personnel</button></div></form></div></div><script src="<?= base_url(); ?>assets/js/vendor.min.js"></script><script src="<?= base_url(); ?>assets/js/app.min.js"></script><?php include(__DIR__ . '/includes/school_personnel_enhancements.php'); ?></body></html>
